      </div>

      <h2>1. Permitted use</h2>
      <p>You may browse the site, share links, and quote reasonable excerpts where permitted by law. Quotations must preserve context and clearly identify the author, article title, and <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> as the source.</p>

