      <h2>5. Prohibited conduct</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>do not probe, scan, or test the site's security without authorisation;</li>
        <li>do not bypass security measures, rate limits, access controls, or technical restrictions;</li>
        <li>do not upload malicious code or interfere with the operation of the service;</li>
        <li>do not impersonate <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span>, its authors, editors, or partners;</li>
        <li>do not remove attribution, copyright notices, credits, or rights information;</li>
