      <h2>6. Submissions and communications</h2>
      <p>You remain responsible for material you send to us. Do not submit confidential information unless we have agreed in advance to receive it on that basis. Sending an unsolicited idea, pitch, or manuscript does not create a confidential, fiduciary, employment, or agency relationship.</p>

      <h2>7. Donations and payments</h2>
      <p>Donations are separate from subscriptions and editorial decisions. A donation does not purchase editorial influence, publication, preferential treatment, or rights in any <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> work.</p>

